<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sv">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Betalning lyckades - Mikael Dolfe</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Din betalning har genomförts framgångsrikt">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;700&family=Source+Sans+Pro:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        .success-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 8rem; /* Add space for fixed header */
        }
        
        .success-icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #27ae60, #229954);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: white;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        
        .success-title {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        }
        
        .success-message {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #7f8c8d;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        .order-details {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            text-align: left;
        }
        
        .order-details h3 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .detail-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;
        }
        
        .detail-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        
        .detail-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }
        
        .detail-value {
            color: #7f8c8d;
        }
        
        .book-info {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .book-cover {
            width: 60px;
            height: 90px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 5px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .book-cover-placeholder {
            width: 60px;
            height: 90px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e9ecef, #dee2e6);
            border-radius: 5px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .book-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }
        
        .book-price {
            color: #e74c3c;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        
        .delivery-info {
            background: #e8f5e8;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            border-left: 4px solid #27ae60;
        }
        
        .delivery-info h4 {
            color: #27ae60;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .delivery-address {
            color: #2c3e50;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        
        .next-steps {
            background: #fff3cd;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;
        }
        
        .next-steps h4 {
            color: #856404;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .next-steps ul {
            text-align: left;
            color: #856404;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-left: 0.7rem;
        }
        
        .next-steps li {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3498db, #2980b9);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            margin: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.4);
        }
        
        .btn-secondary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #95a5a6, #7f8c8d);
        }
        
        .btn-secondary:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(149, 165, 166, 0.4);
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .success-container {
                padding: 1rem;
                margin-top: 12rem; /* Extra space for mobile header */
            }
            
            .success-title {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            
            .success-icon {
                width: 60px;
                height: 60px;
                font-size: 2rem;
                margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .success-message {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }
            
            .detail-row {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 0.25rem;
            }
            
            .book-info {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
                gap: 0.5rem;
            }
            
            .order-details,
            .delivery-info,
            .next-steps {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .btn {
                display: block;
                width: 100%;
                margin: 0.5rem 0;
                text-align: center;
            }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .success-container {
                padding: 0.5rem;
            }
            
            .success-title {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            
            .success-icon {
                width: 50px;
                height: 50px;
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            
            .order-details,
            .delivery-info,
            .next-steps {
                padding: 1rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('components/header') %>

    <main>
        <div class="success-container">
            <div class="success-icon">✓</div>
            <h1 class="success-title">Betalning lyckades!</h1>
            <p class="success-message">
                Tack för ditt köp! Din betalning har genomförts framgångsrikt och din beställning har registrerats.
            </p>
            
            <div class="order-details">
                <h3>Beställningsdetaljer</h3>
                
                <div class="book-info">
                    <% if (book.cover_image) { %>
                        <img src="<%= book.cover_image %>" alt="<%= book.title %>" class="book-cover">
                    <% } else { %>
                        <div class="book-cover-placeholder">
                            Omslagsbild saknas
                        </div>
                    <% } %>
                    <div>
                        <div class="book-title"><%= book.title %></div>
                        <% if (book.subtitle) { %>
                            <div style="color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 0.9rem; font-style: italic;"><%= book.subtitle %></div>
                        <% } %>
                        <div class="book-price"><%= order.amount %> SEK</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Beställningsnummer:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">#<%= order.id %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Betalnings-ID:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value"><%= order.stripe_payment_intent_id %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Beställningsdatum:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value"><%= new Date(order.created_at).toLocaleDateString('sv-SE') %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Status:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value" style="color: #27ae60; font-weight: 600;">Betalad</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="delivery-info">
                <h4>Leveransinformation</h4>
                <div class="delivery-address">
                    <strong><%= order.customer_name %></strong><br>
                    <%= order.delivery_address.address %><br>
                    <% if (order.delivery_address.address2) { %>
                        <%= order.delivery_address.address2 %><br>
                    <% } %>
                    <%= order.delivery_address.postalCode %> <%= order.delivery_address.city %>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="next-steps">
                <h4>Vad händer nu?</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Du kommer att få en bekräftelse via e-post på <strong><%= order.customer_email %></strong></li>
                    <li>Din bok kommer att skickas inom 1-2 arbetsdagar</li>
                    <li>Du får ett spårningsnummer när boken skickas</li>
                    <li>Leveranstid: 2-5 arbetsdagar inom Sverige</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div>
                <a href="/" class="btn">Tillbaka till startsidan</a>
                <a href="/#bocker" class="btn btn-secondary">Se fler böcker</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('components/footer') %>

    <script src="/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>


